    "lineId": "evacuation_line_03",
    "startMs": 9000,
    "endMs": 11200,
    "speakerLabel": "CIVIL-DEFENSE",
    "text": "繰り返します。第4居住区の方は、最寄りの地下通路へ。"
  },
  {
    "chunkId": "tx_evacuation_03b",
    "transmissionId": "tx_evacuation",
    "lineId": "evacuation_line_03",
    "startMs": 11800,
    "endMs": 14200,
    "speakerLabel": "CIVIL-DEFENSE",
    "text": "A-3、A-4ゲートは閉鎖。北側の誘導灯に従ってください。",
    "importance": "important"
  },
  {
    "chunkId": "tx_evacuation_04a",
